**Requirements:** None  
**How to start:** Speak with [Cloyne](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247434)  
**Cost:** Depends on the level  
**Objective:** Pay the cost, then open one of the three chests that appear. One will contain the prize, while the other two contain a Green Rupee.  
**Cost / Reward:**
- Bet 10 Rupees for a Red Rupee;
- Bet 50 Rupees for a Silver Rupee;
- Bet 100 Rupees for a Gold Rupee;

**Location:** On the rocky islands, near the beach.  
**Puzzle:** Flower Order - Touch all the flower patches, from least to most amount of flowers, to spawn the Korok.
- Patches 1 and 2 are on the western island;
- Patch 3 is on the central island;
- Patches 4 and 5 are on this (the eastern) island;

**Location:** In a chest, only openable after completing [Divine Beast Vah Naboris](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=248651)  
**Shield Guard:** 48  
**Durability:** 30  
**Other effect:** Can be repaired by bringing [Buliara](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=248712):
- 1x Gerudo Shield;
- 1x Diamond;
- 5x Flint;

**Scales into:** None

**Location:** In a chest, only openable after completing [Divine Beast Vah Naboris](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=248651)  
**Weapon Type:** One-Handed  
**Attack Power:** 32  
**Durability:** 60  
**Other effect:** Can be repaired by bringing [Buliara](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=248712):
- 1x Gerudo Scimitar;
- 1x Diamond;
- 5x Flint;

**Scales into:** None

**Location:** Embedded in a tree trunk; see [The Hero's Sword](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=248587).  
**Weapon Type:** One-Handed  
**Attack Power:** 30  
**Durability:** 40  
**Other effect:**
- Grows to 60 Attack Power near Guardians, in Hyrule Castle and in Divine Beasts;
- Doesn't consume a weapon slot (occupied its own permanant slot);
- Instead of breaking, goes dormant for a while, and can be used again afterwards;
- When at full Health, the Thrown attack shoots a laser beam instead

**Scales into:** None

**Requirements:** Start [Find Kheel](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247039)  
**How to start:** Speak with [Kheel](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247040)  
**Solution:**
1. Find three of Kheel's sisters ([Notts](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247042), [Cree](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247044) and [Kotts](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247043)) and speak with them to get ingredients.
2. Head to the kitchen with [Genli](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247045) and cook him a Salmon Meunière with these ingredients.
3. Speak with [Kheel](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247040) to get a Korok Leaf.
4. From the pedestal, blow wind in the hand-shaped statues, in the following order, to reveal the shrine:
    - 4 fingers;
    - 5 fingers;
    - 3 fingers;
    - 1 finger;
    - 2 fingers;
    - The number of fingers corresponds to the positions of the singing Ritos during their song.

**Reward:** Unlocks the [Voo Lota Shrine](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=225133)

**Requirements:** Locked Mementos  
**How to start:** Speak with either [Akrah](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247320), [Onya](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247323) or [Garshon](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=247322)  
**Walkthrough:** Show each brother the picture he wants to see:
- Show Garshon a picture of the [Gerudo Great Skeleton](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=246046);
- Show Onya a picture of the [Hebra Great Skeleton](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=246048);
- Show Akrah a picture of the [Eldin Great Skeleton](https://mapgenie.io/zelda-breath-of-the-wild/maps/hyrule?locationIds=246306);

**Reward:** Gold Rupee

